Soalnya, kamu bikin aku jijik
terus, aku jadi nggak tahan...

01:44:33.866 --> 01:44:35.633
Ah, iya.

01:44:36.800 --> 01:44:38.200
Trik yang bagus.

01:44:41.533 --> 01:44:45.000
Nggak usah ditahan. Enak.

01:44:45.966 --> 01:44:47.366
..

01:44:56.733 --> 01:45:03.300
Enak...

01:45:31.033 --> 01:45:38.433
Enak...

01:45:39.400 --> 01:45:40.500
Hebat...

01:45:44.966 --> 01:45:47.366
Enak...

01:45:52.633 --> 01:45:55.000
Enak...

01:45:55.900 --> 01:45:59.933
Ou-kun, enak...

01:46:20.400 --> 01:46:21.866
...

01:46:34.600 --> 01:46:36.233
Kamu bisa melakukan itu juga?

01:46:44.200 --> 01:46:45.466
Enak...

01:46:52.233 --> 01:46:58.466
Ah, enak...

01:47:28.666 --> 01:47:30.300
Keluar lagi...

01:47:30.833 --> 01:47:32.900
Sudah keluar lagi...

01:48:07.066 --> 01:48:08.066
Napas anjing.

01:48:23.200 --> 01:48:24.533
Cakar aku.

01:48:53.400 --> 01:48:56.866
Pantat yang lucu. Pantatnya berhenti.

01:49:04.633 --> 01:49:05.600
..

01:49:22.900 --> 01:49:24.300
Begini...

01:49:38.566 --> 01:49:40.100
Yume...

01:49:59.400 --> 01:50:07.400
Mari kita mulai. Biar aku yang
mulai. Lalu serahkan aku. Tolong aku.

01:50:25.000 --> 01:50:41.433
Tolong! Tolong aku! Ah!

01:50:41.600 --> 01:50:42.766
AH!!!

01:51:07.666 --> 01:53:16.333
Aaaah... aaaah... aaaah... gimana dong, Tamae. Tamae, tusuk aku yang banyak.
Yang banyak, tusuk aku... Aaaah... Mam, kalau begitu, syuting dimulai!

01:53:16.366 --> 01:53:19.700
Namanya Rinu. Aku
kenal dia. Dan dia itu...

01:53:45.000 --> 01:53:46.166
Aku lumayan capek.

01:53:48.333 --> 01:53:52.033
Dan aku benar-benar lelah. Rasanya aku sudah tak sanggup
melihat apa-apa lagi. Jadi, mari kita istirahat dulu.

01:53:54.533 --> 01:53:55.533
Istirahatlah sebentar.

01:53:57.300 --> 01:54:05.133
Waktu istirahat yang singkat benar-benar bikin capek. Kamu bisa istirahat
sekarang juga. Jangan bilang kamu malah mau bersenang-senang. Capek banget.

01:54:11.800 --> 01:54:14.533
Rumah...

01:54:16.433 --> 01:54:20.700
Rumah berkat...

01:54:22.766 --> 01:54:32.200
Tolong penuhi yang
itu... terus gimana?

01:55:05.733 --> 01:55:20.500
Maaf. Itu urusan tuan. Ahhh!

01:55:20.500 --> 01:55:24.466
Mataku...

01:55:33.166 --> 01:55:34.400
Bagus banget.

01:55:35.533 --> 01:55:38.000
Enak banget. Enak, ya?

01:55:38.300 --> 01:55:39.300
Aku juga.

01:55:39.500 --> 01:55:44.833
Aku juga ngerasa
enak banget. Buka.

01:56:14.400 --> 01:56:19.400
Buka... jangan... hentikan...

01:56:35.800 --> 01:56:38.233
Dingin. Biar aku yang urus
serangan dadakan dari belakang!

01:56:38.233 --> 01:56:40.300
Pas banget, mulai!

01:56:53.900 --> 01:56:55.666
Cepat dan bagus,
sangat teliti. Kita teman.

01:56:57.333 --> 01:56:58.333
Aku jalan-jalan.

01:56:59.200 --> 01:57:04.866
Banyak. Mau sebanyak itu?

01:57:13.133 --> 01:57:17.700
Paham banget.

01:57:19.733 --> 01:57:20.933
Enggak.

01:57:23.833 --> 01:57:24.833
Jangan...

01:57:28.200 --> 01:57:32.600
Aaaaargh.

01:57:34.466 --> 01:57:35.800
Waduh, gawat nih.

01:57:36.600 --> 01:57:40.700
Ah, jangan. Lets, masuk ke situ!

01:57:40.933 --> 01:57:47.700
Ah, buruan.

01:57:58.833 --> 01:58:01.400
Tapi tetap harus tertawa.

01:58:03.900 --> 01:58:04.900
Belum?

01:58:10.933 --> 01:58:14.333
Padahal sudah keluar
banyak, masih kuat ya?

01:58:14.833 --> 01:58:18.533
Masih kuat kok.
Kamu nggak apa-apa?

01:58:18.766 --> 01:58:21.066
Tenang, kau kan manis.

01:58:23.166 --> 01:58:25.533
Bukan Kenji juga ya, ternyata.

01:58:57.566 --> 01:59:00.600
Beda ya sama Kenji. Mau kubuang
ke luar, kubuang ke luar. Paham?

01:59:14.066 --> 01:59:15.066
Gila.

01:59:34.866 --> 01:59:37.166
Seram banget, kan?

01:59:40.533 --> 01:59:41.666
Penuh.

01:59:44.300 --> 01:59:45.300
Enak.

01:59:53.200 --> 01:59:55.933
Gue berangkat kerja ya.
Jangan bikin masalah sama Tai.

01:59:56.033 --> 01:59:57.700
Oke, paham.

01:59:59.266 --> 02:00:00.266
Aku pergi dulu.

02:00:00.766 --> 02:00:01.766
Hati-hati.
